WEBVTT

00:09:28.000 --> 00:09:31.000
koje nikada nećemo upoznati

00:09:31.000 --> 00:09:32.810
da ga sačuvamo

00:09:33.740 --> 00:09:34.910
i prenesemo dalje.

00:09:34.910 --> 00:09:35.910
Hvala vam.

00:09:35.910 --> 00:09:39.000
(Aplauz)

00:09:39.000 --> 00:09:41.000
Hvala vam.

00:09:43.460 --> 00:09:45.780
Hvala vam.

00:09:54.460 --> 00:09:55.460
Dakle,

00:09:56.060 --> 00:09:58.710
ostajem ovde jer

00:09:58.970 --> 00:10:01.710
želimo da vam demonstriramo